+        f"| **P4** (TCA attractor masking & specificity) | **{v['P4_tca_attractor_masking_and_specificity']}** | "
+        f"TRM F1/F6=`{mm['trm_tca_f1_over_flate_mean']:.3f}`, max(|z|>3)=`{100*mm['trm_tca_max_spec_gt3']:.2f}%` |",
